  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products: <br>Harbor &amp; Thorne is a modern apparel brand focused on refined everyday wear for men and women. Our collections are built around clean design, versatile styling, and pieces that feel intentional—made to be worn daily while still standing out. We focus on combining comfort, structure, and visual edge so customers can upgrade how they look without overthinking it.<br><br>• What makes us different:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">We prioritize pieces that look sharp without trying too hard. Instead of trend-driven fashion, we focus on styles that feel relevant long-term—clean silhouettes, strong fits, and details that elevate simple outfits. Our products are designed to help customers look more put-together with minimal effort.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Affiliates earn competitive commissions on every sale generated through their unique link or coupon code. With a broad catalog of high-demand apparel and strong visual appeal, our products convert well across multiple audiences and platforms.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Harbor &amp; Thorne performs best with visual-first content. Use lifestyle imagery, outfit inspiration, and short-form video (TikTok, Reels, Pinterest) that highlights how the pieces upgrade everyday style. Focus on transformation—before vs. after, simple outfit upgrades, and effortless styling.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><br></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"><br></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"><br></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\"><br></div></div></div>",
